WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.080
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a comedy family film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:16.320
called “I'm Underage But I'm Not a&nbsp;
Child”. Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:22.400
Oriyama Karin is the daughter of a billionaire&nbsp;
businessman, Oriyama Kazuki. She has been treated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:28.240
like a princess from a young age and knows little&nbsp;
to nothing about the world outside her mansion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:34.000
Karin has everything she wants and her only dream&nbsp;
is to marry a prince one day. On the morning of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.160
her sixteenth birthday, her personal bodyguard&nbsp;
Kaburaki and the maids wake her up and carry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:46.080
her to the bathroom. Karin, who is still half&nbsp;
asleep, doesn't realize she is being picked up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.360
They bathe her and get her ready in her school&nbsp;
uniform. After being pampered, she is told that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:56.960
she has received gifts from several billionaires&nbsp;
from around the world like Mark Zukerberg and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:03.280
Bernard Arnault. She is then seated in her limo&nbsp;
and driven to school like usual. On her way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:10.400
her classmate and friend Ebina Isuzu brings her&nbsp;
flowers. Like Karin, he also belongs to a wealthy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:16.720
family. He has had a crush on her for a long time&nbsp;
but she only thinks of him as a friend. At school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:22.240
Karin hears the girls gush about a good looking&nbsp;
guy who has just been admitted to the school. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:28.480
follows them to take a look at him herself. Like&nbsp;
the other girls, Karin is also mesmerized by Nao&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:33.840
Tsurugi’s beauty. Watching him play football,&nbsp;
she instantly feels attracted to him. Without&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:39.200
thinking much about it, she walks to the field&nbsp;
and is hit by the ball. The impact almost makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:45.200
her fall when Nao catches her. Because of the&nbsp;
gesture, the princess falls in love with him. 
&nbsp;

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:50.240
In the evening, her parents throw an extravagant&nbsp;
birthday party for her. They sing, dance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:55.440
and have a lot of fun. For her gift, Karin&nbsp;
is given a wedding dress. It turns out that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.440 --> 00:02:01.760
a prophet had told her father that she is bound to&nbsp;
get married the day after her sixteenth birthday.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:07.440
The husband will turn Karin into a better person&nbsp;
and will provide her life long happiness. Karin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:13.120
refuses to marry anyone who is not Nao. She throws&nbsp;
a fit, breaking the utensils and destroying the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:18.720
place without letting her father explain himself.&nbsp;
Only after he shows her the picture of her future&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:25.040
husband does she realize that she is being married&nbsp;
to Nao. Kazuki has bought her a husband of her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:30.800
choice for her sixteenth birthday. The following&nbsp;
day, she and Nao are at the altar. When they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:35.680
asked to exchange rings, he claims that since they&nbsp;
are keeping their marriage a secret, it is better&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:41.520
if they skip that part. Karin is ready to do as&nbsp;
he says so she doesn’t object. Since they are too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:46.720
young to be married, they have decided to not tell&nbsp;
anyone at school. After the wedding, he brings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:52.640
her to his house that only has one bedroom that is&nbsp;
the size of her closet at her mansion. She is told&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:57.760
that she will have to adjust now that her husband&nbsp;
is poor. Karin is skeptical about how two people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:02.640
are going to fit in the house but she trusts&nbsp;
her husband to make her feel comfortable. 
&nbsp;

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:08.080
She is excited about her first night with Nao but&nbsp;
is confused when he asks her to stay in her side&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:13.360
of the room. He reveals that he doesn’t love her&nbsp;
and only married her because he wanted to inherit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:18.720
her father’s wealth. He calls her shallow for&nbsp;
choosing him because of his looks and also says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:24.720
that he hates her. Karin falls asleep hoping&nbsp;
that everything that happened is just a dream.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:30.400
When she wakes up the next day it is already 10&nbsp;
pm. She doesn’t have a habit of waking up on her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:35.600
own so she is late for school. The landlady&nbsp;
tells her that Nao left early in the morning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:41.520
without her. Karin tries to take a shower but&nbsp;
doesn’t know how to turn on hot water. Getting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:46.800
ready for school is difficult for her without the&nbsp;
help of her maids. After struggling to do basic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:52.880
tasks the entire morning, she leaves for school&nbsp;
but gets lost in the way. After wandering around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:58.480
the city for hours, she reaches school when it is&nbsp;
already over. Isuzu asks her where she had been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:03.840
all day but Karin cannot tell him because then&nbsp;
she would have to explain that she got married.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:09.520
When she reaches home at night, a furious Nao is&nbsp;
waiting for her to explain the mess she had made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:15.360
in the house. She cries about not knowing how to&nbsp;
do simple tasks which makes him feel bad for her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:19.840
Starting the next day, he promises to help&nbsp;
her get used to the new lifestyle. 
&nbsp;

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:24.800
He teaches her to turn on hot water, to clean&nbsp;
using a vacuum cleaner, and to cook instant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:30.960
ramen. In only a few days, Karin gets used to&nbsp;
her new life. One day, she cooks a meal for him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:37.200
which surprisingly tastes delicious. However,&nbsp;
Nao soon finds out that she used almost half&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:42.240
of their monthly allowance for the meal. As he&nbsp;
starts to panic, Karin simply calls her father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:47.280
Kazuki to ask for money. The pair is called to&nbsp;
the mansion where they explain the situation to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:52.320
her father. He offers to help them but Nao&nbsp;
declines it. He wants to live on a budget&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.320 --> 00:05:01.520
and not take advantage of Kazuki’s kindness. The&nbsp;
parents are impressed by his wise words. At night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:06.480
the couple stays at the mansion. The next morning&nbsp;
when they are about to leave, Karin apologizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:12.240
to the cooks for always throwing their food away.&nbsp;
After she started to cook for herself she realized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:18.480
how difficult of a task it is. Her parents and&nbsp;
bodyguard Kaburaki are shocked. They erupt into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:24.080
cheers claiming that this is the first time she&nbsp;
has apologized to anyone. During school lunch,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:29.200
the pair sit at different tables to not seem&nbsp;
suspicious. Karin’s friend Isuzu notices her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:35.040
looking at Nao but doesn’t think much of it. When&nbsp;
a group of girls surround Nao offering him food,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:40.320
she gets jealous and asks them to go away.
When she realizes what she did, she makes up an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:47.120
excuse and sits down quietly. A girl named&nbsp;
Saaya looks at Nao and walks away angrily.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:52.960
Nao calls her by her name which makes Karin even&nbsp;
more jealous. On reaching home, she confronts him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:59.120
about Saaya but Nao refuses to talk. When she&nbsp;
insists, he storms out of the house. They see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:04.720
each other again in the morning but do not talk.&nbsp;
Karin makes it her mission to find out about Saaya&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:09.680
and Nao’s relationship. She hardly has to do&nbsp;
anything because Saaya approaches her during&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:15.040
lunch break and asks her if she is dating Nao.&nbsp;
Karin wants to tell her she is married to him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:20.000
but she refrains from it. Saaya assumes that&nbsp;
they are dating and asks her to break up with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:24.960
him immediately. She claims that he is only&nbsp;
dating her for money and will leave her once&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:30.720
his school debt is paid. An innocent Karin sees&nbsp;
no wrong in dating someone for money. In fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:36.080
she is happy to give him some since her father has&nbsp;
a lot of it. Nao listens to their conversation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:42.480
delighted that Karin didn’t overreact. At home,&nbsp;
he helps her dry her hair and is nicer in general.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:48.320
Karin notices the change in behavior but doesn’t&nbsp;
say anything. The next day, Nao finds out that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:53.920
Karin has been passing her tests with the help&nbsp;
of her bodyguard and her friend Isuzu. Hence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:58.720
he starts to tutor her every day.
At first, Karin struggles to keep up but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:04.400
she soon gets a hang of it. She even takes notes&nbsp;
in class surprising her teacher and classmates.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:10.160
Nao agrees to go on a date with her if she gets&nbsp;
good grades which encourages her to study harder.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:15.920
One day she is in the library when Isuzu asks her&nbsp;
if she is dating someone. Karin tells him she just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:21.600
wants to get better grades but he has started&nbsp;
to suspect her. She gets an A on her next test&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:28.320
and is overjoyed. While returning home, a crowd of&nbsp;
men in black clothes kidnaps her. They take her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:34.240
Isuzu’s mansion. It turns out that he has found&nbsp;
out about her marriage to Nao and doesn’t approve&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:39.120
of it. He threatens to tell the school principal&nbsp;
about it and get them expelled if she doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:45.120
divorce him instantly. Karin is left shocked. The&nbsp;
guy she thought was her best friend turned out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:51.200
to be an obsessive lunatic. Later, she is in one&nbsp;
of the rooms of his house when Nao calls her. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:56.160
has been looking for her all day and is worried.&nbsp;
She tells him everything about what happened with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.160 --> 00:08:02.000
Isuzu and asks him to come to pick her up. Nao&nbsp;
doesn’t think twice before coming to get his wife.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:07.840
He is welcomed by Isuzu’s bodyguards who do not&nbsp;
let him see Karin before talking to him. 
&nbsp;

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:12.880
Isuzu knows that Nao married Karin for her money.&nbsp;
He tells Nao that he can never provide Karin with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:18.800
the love and happiness she deserves. Having known&nbsp;
Karin since childhood, Isuzu knows everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:24.320
about her dreams and aspirations. She wanted to&nbsp;
dance with her significant other as a princess&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:29.280
and wanted to have a grand wedding with hundreds&nbsp;
of guests but Nao couldn’t even give her that.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:34.880
Nao, who has started to fall in love with her,&nbsp;
realizes that she deserves someone like Isuzu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:41.360
who can fulfill all her wishes. Isuzu asks him&nbsp;
to divorce Karin if he really cares about her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:46.560
When Nao later meets her, she asks him to come&nbsp;
home. However, Nao wants her to stay the night&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:52.080
at her parents’ house because his house has no&nbsp;
electricity. She retaliates but he agrees to go on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:58.160
a date with her tomorrow and calms her. The next&nbsp;
day, they meet on a bridge and go to an aquarium&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:04.240
where Karin had always wanted to visit. Nao&nbsp;
compliments her outfit, making her blush. They eat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:09.920
several street foods, talk about different things&nbsp;
and run around on the beach. In the end, they sit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:15.200
down to talk. Karin lists all the things that she&nbsp;
has noticed about Nao, like the fact that he hates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:20.240
the noise of utensils breaking. He reveals that&nbsp;
his mother used to break stuff when she got mad,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:25.520
so he has developed a hatred for such noises.&nbsp;
They promise to support each other for eternity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:30.400
and ring a bell on a shrine. Right after,&nbsp;
Nao suggests they get a divorce. 
&nbsp;

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:37.200
Karin returns home shocked and devastated. The&nbsp;
next day, Nao drops out of school and gets into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:43.040
a massive argument with his mother. He wants to&nbsp;
do his best to not see Karin. Karin’s parents are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:49.440
worried for her but can do nothing to change Nao’s&nbsp;
mind. In the meantime, Isuzu visits her and asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:54.880
her to go out with him. He brings her to a palace&nbsp;
where they dance as she had always wanted to with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.880 --> 00:10:00.560
her prince. Karin enjoys his company but knows&nbsp;
that she would rather live in a tiny home with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:07.920
Nao than in a palace. When they are done dancing,&nbsp;
Isuzu proposes to her. Somewhere else, Kaburaki&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:13.280
meets Nao and gives him the divorce papers. He&nbsp;
also hands him a princess book that used to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:17.840
Karin’s favorite. After reading the book, Nao&nbsp;
gets to know more about what she wants in life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:24.960
It also makes him realize that he cannot give her&nbsp;
up at any cost. He runs to Isuzu’s house asking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:29.520
him to stay out of his and Karin’s relationship.&nbsp;
He appears to be determined about winning her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:35.600
back. Isuzu tells him that Karin refused to marry&nbsp;
him because she is in love with Nao. He wants her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:41.760
to be happy even if it means helping her get back&nbsp;
together with him. Nao happily runs back to their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:46.880
house, knowing that Karin would be there. 
The two finally meet each other and kiss.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:52.000
Karin asks him if he likes her to which Nao&nbsp;
replies that he has fallen in love with her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:57.120
Cut to five years later, Karin and Nao&nbsp;
are getting married yet again. This time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:02.240
the church is filled with guests, and the&nbsp;
two exchange rings. In the last scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:07.680
they kiss as the crowd erupts in cheers. 
